{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35387","headline":"回鸾阁写望 · 张乔","name":"回鸾阁写望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古阁上空半，寥寥千里心。\n多年爲客路，尽日倚栏吟。\n山压秦川重，河来虏塞深。\n回銮今不见，烟雾杳沉沉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35387.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35387","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}